‎## 6. Principle — Rule #14 Candidate
‎
‎**Proposed Rule #14: Choices Have Consequences**
‎
‎> **Rule #14:** A choice is an object of fear and promise, of ridicule and power. It does nothing but represents the power to do everything. It belongs to us to protect. Make a choice and decide what you want your life to be. Because choices have consequences: Choice → Intent → Command → Execution → Consequence → Feedback → Learning → Advance.
‎
