‎
‎## 7. Final Synthesis — Your Two Lines as One System
‎
‎**Line 1:** Make a Choice and decide what you want your life to be.
‎**Line 2:** CHOICES HAVE CONSEQUENCES!
‎
‎Together:
‎
‎> **Decide what you want your life to be — then bear what that decision creates. That is how inhabitants survive forest transitions. That is how code becomes system. That is how knowledge compounds.**
